# issue: none
# notes: Merge all 64 changed vectors into a diverged target; exact rows on both branches, including the unrelated target insert. One operation on a fresh handle is timed; checks and restart are outside the timer.

--- runner
timeout_ms: 60000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem

--- mutate
branch merge "source" into "main"
--- expect outcome: merged

--- query
branch list

--- expect unordered
{"name":"main"}
{"name":"source"}
--- expect shape
name: String

--- query branch: main
query chunk_rows() { match { $c: Chunk } return { $c.slug as slug, $c.embedding as embedding } }

